+
+Page modules under `src/pages` (excluding tests): **635** · routed: **599** · in dashboard nav: **363** · page test files: **46** · e2e specs: **5**
+
+| Tier | Pages | Routed | In nav | Backend real | Page test exists |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
