+  L.push('> **Generated file — do not edit by hand.** Regenerate with `npm run docs:surface`; CI runs `npm run docs:surface:check`.');
+  L.push('> Source of truth for tiers: [`src/lib/productSurface.manifest.json`](../src/lib/productSurface.manifest.json).');
+  L.push('');
+  L.push('## How to read this');
