+  L.push('- **Tier** — **Core**: part of the pilot product (jobs, scheduling/dispatch, customers, calls, quotes, invoices/payments, QuickBooks, warranty, plus the account/auth shell they need). **Secondary**: routed and shipped, not part of the pilot promise; routes keep working. **Unverified**: abstract/experimental surface; hidden (nav and route) for tenants without the `' + manifest.flagKey + '` flag. **Secondary** pages are additionally left out of the *nav* for tenants without `' + manifest.navFlagKey + '` (see Gating).');
