+  L.push(`| \`${manifest.flagKey}\` | Unverified pages: **nav entry and route** (direct URL redirects to \`/dashboard\` with a toast; waits for the flag lookup, fails closed after 4 s) | OFF | grandfathered ON by the migration |`);
